<title>UK: Niederoesterreichische LB  sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Niederoesterreichische LB  sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIEDEROESTERREICHISCHE LANDESBANK HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BUNDESLAND NIEDEROESTERREICH</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    07.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.625   PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   24.APR.97</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
